@startuml

!pragma layout smetana
left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 28
skinparam ranksep 36
hide empty members

package "Editor Tools\n(#if UNITY_EDITOR asset generation)" as EditorTools {
  class MeshCombiner {
    +IsInitialized
    +IsFaulted
    +Init()
    +Release()
  }

  class BackfaceCullMeshBaker {
    +IsInitialized
    +IsFaulted
    +Init()
    +Release()
  }

  class PhysicsRecorder {
    +IsInitialized
    +IsFaulted
    +Init()
    +StartRecording(duration, animName)
    +StopRecording()
    +Release()
  }
}

package "Unity Types" as UnityTypes {
  class MeshFilter <<Unity>>
  class Camera <<Unity>>
  class Material <<Unity>>
  class Mesh <<Unity>>
  class Rigidbody <<Unity>>
  class Transform <<Unity>>
  class AnimationClip <<Unity>>
  class GameObject <<Unity>>
}

MeshCombiner --> MeshFilter : reads input
MeshCombiner --> Camera : optional culling target
MeshCombiner --> Material : groups by material
MeshCombiner --> Mesh : combines / saves

BackfaceCullMeshBaker --> MeshFilter : reads / replaces
BackfaceCullMeshBaker --> Camera : camera direction
BackfaceCullMeshBaker --> Mesh : bakes / saves

PhysicsRecorder --> Rigidbody : tracks children
PhysicsRecorder --> Transform : records local pose
PhysicsRecorder --> AnimationClip : saves curves
PhysicsRecorder --> GameObject : saves prefab

note right of EditorTools
Mesh combination, culling bake and physics recording
asset-generation paths are guarded by #if UNITY_EDITOR.
Only core editor asset-generation paths are shown.
end note

@enduml
